  "instance_name": "absurd_appliance_concept",
  "label": "Absurd Appliance Concept",
  "description": "The idea that a single appliance can perform two vastly different and unrelated functions — such as dishwashing and sandwich making — is inherently nonsensical and humorous. This concept relies on real-world knowledge of appliance functionality and the expectation that household appliances are specialized tools. The humor stems from the violation of this expectation, which is a common trope in satire and comedy.",
